{"id":"0bbbc1d1201e91c0","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-order12-algebraic-poset.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Algebraic Poset","display":"df-zfc-order12-algebraic-poset — ZFC Order12 Algebraic Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-algebraic-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-algebraic-poset","58-df-zfc-order7-algebraic-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-algebraic-poset — ZFC Order12 Algebraic Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-algebraic-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-algebraic-poset</span><span>58-df-zfc-order7-algebraic-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-algebraic-poset — ZFC Order12 Algebraic Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd92cc6b411eb77\" href=\"?note=3cd92cc6b411eb77\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,K,X,R\\in V\">\\(P,K,X,R\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S\\)</span> are the carrier-explicit predicates defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AlgebraicPoset}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AlgebraicPoset}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AlgebraicPoset}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AlgebraicPoset}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}directed}\\vdash\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S(D,X,R)\\leftrightarrow D\\neq\\varnothing\\land D\\subseteq X\\land\\forall a,b\\in D\\;\\exists c\\in D\\;(\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}directed}\\vdash\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S(D,X,R)\\leftrightarrow D\\neq\\varnothing\\land D\\subseteq X\\land\\forall a,b\\in D\\;\\exists c\\in D\\;(\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}supremum}\\vdash\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S(s,D,X,R)\\leftrightarrow s\\in X\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall u\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}supremum}\\vdash\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S(s,D,X,R)\\leftrightarrow s\\in X\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall u\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}compact}\\vdash\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,X,R)\\leftrightarrow k\\in X\\land\\forall D\\subseteq X\\;\\forall s\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S(D,X,R)\\land\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S(s,D,X,R)\\land\\langle k,s\\rangle\\in R\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle k,d\\rangle\\in R)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}compact}\\vdash\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,X,R)\\leftrightarrow k\\in X\\land\\forall D\\subseteq X\\;\\forall s\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S(D,X,R)\\land\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S(s,D,X,R)\\land\\langle k,s\\rangle\\in R\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle k,d\\rangle\\in R)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AlgebraicPoset}_S(P,R,K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S(P,R)\\land K=\\{k\\in P:\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,P,R)\\}\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S(\\{k\\in K:\\langle k,x\\rangle\\in R\\},P,R)\\land\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S(x,\\{k\\in K:\\langle k,x\\rangle\\in R\\},P,R)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AlgebraicPoset}_S(P,R,K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S(P,R)\\land K=\\{k\\in P:\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,P,R)\\}\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S(\\{k\\in K:\\langle k,x\\rangle\\in R\\},P,R)\\land\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S(x,\\{k\\in K:\\langle k,x\\rangle\\in R\\},P,R)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AlgebraicPoset}_S(X,R,K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AlgebraicPoset}_S(X,R,K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AlgebraicPoset}_S(X,R,K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AlgebraicPoset}_S(X,R,K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个元素必须是其下方紧元素构成的有向集的上确界；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 被固定为全部紧元素，而非任意可生成子集。</li>\n<li>order7 名称是同一三元谓词的兼容别名。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd92cc6b411eb77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,K,X,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AlgebraicPoset}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AlgebraicPoset}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}directed}\\vdash\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S(D,X,R)\\leftrightarrow D\\neq\\varnothing\\land D\\subseteq X\\land\\forall a,b\\in D\\;\\exists c\\in D\\;(\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}supremum}\\vdash\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S(s,D,X,R)\\leftrightarrow s\\in X\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall u\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}compact}\\vdash\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,X,R)\\leftrightarrow k\\in X\\land\\forall D\\subseteq X\\;\\forall s\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S(D,X,R)\\land\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S(s,D,X,R)\\land\\langle k,s\\rangle\\in R\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle k,d\\rangle\\in R)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AlgebraicPoset}_S(P,R,K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S(P,R)\\land K=\\{k\\in P:\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,P,R)\\}\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OrderDirected}_S(\\{k\\in K:\\langle k,x\\rangle\\in R\\},P,R)\\land\\mathrm{OrderSupremum}_S(x,\\{k\\in K:\\langle k,x\\rangle\\in R\\},P,R)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AlgebraicPoset}_S(X,R,K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AlgebraicPoset}_S(X,R,K)","display":true},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":2412,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2901","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-order12-algebraic-poset.md|58-df-zfc-orde